7359_1411155443060399617_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pxoXu_ciiPAQ7kNvwGaLLR4&_nc_oc=Adn5_TdfUszJhA7CJ2GWU-gTenzNdMCx511RlW_Guub9JPBklNnim87A5rhZbW2NXsw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxIBHyRTFIE0IPr90GvwVeCbq_i8qHwBOn6n2h44SABQw&oe=69B41F8B"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "3814418192216575", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223482_3814418195549908_5866507427421967146_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=drFOyNZMJ3sQ7kNvwEW0Yv2&_nc_oc=AdnezaQ0owxFfQ-VeNYxbNclp63hHECdiiPZ446yoqROKPFYGZ6DoSgt0uokH9hQ2W8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyyxJgSryb2PF_5PHo2K0Gg-V06o8q2KhGnDhwAnP-ocA&oe=69B3EE37"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Carbon Ville", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to Carbon Ville \u2013 Your Ultimate Virtual Fitness Oasis on Meta Oculus! \n\nImmerse yourself in the future of workouts with our groundbreaking VR app. Join instructor-led spin classes, embark on interactive fitness adventures, and connect with a vibrant global community. Elevate your routine with stunning environments and spatial audio.  All you need is a stationary bike and your headset.\n\nKey Features:\n\nComing Soon : Multiplayer Workouts: Connect with friends and fitness enthusiasts in real time. Available in the paid version for an even more engaging experience.\n\nOn-Demand Classes: Enjoy flexibility with on-demand classes at your fingertips. Take your fitness journey anywhere, anytime.\n\nMassive Video Library: Access a vast library of workout videos for all fitness levels and preferences.\n\nEco-Friendly Rewards: Earn points for every workout, converted into real tree plantings worldwide. Make your fitness routine a positive force for the planet.\n\nWhy Carbon Ville?\nUnleash the power of immersive fitness in Carbon Ville. Upgrade soon to the paid version for multiplayer fun and a comprehensive video library. Your 